{"description":"WE ARE ANKATECH","image":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/ANKATECH1.2e16d0ba.fill-300x250.png","summary":"We developed an interactive website that allows uses to get more in touch with the data we get from EIC through sonificiation techniques that involve spectrograms.","details":"<p>Our project pulls data from various NASA databases then uses said data along with our very own sonification algorithm to create a multisensory experience.</p>","dataRefs":[["NASA","https://science.nasa.gov/"],["GISS GISTEMP v4","https://data.giss.nasa.gov/gistemp/"],["SVS 5196 DYAMOND","https://svs.gsfc.nasa.gov/5196/"],["NSDIC AMSR2","https://nsidc.org/data/au_si12"],["MODIS MOD10A1","https://nsidc.org/data/mod10a1"],["MODIS MCD12Q1","https://lpdaac.usgs.gov/products/mcd12q1v061/"],["GPM IMERG","https://gpm.nasa.gov/data/imerg"],["MODIS MOD04","https://modis-atmos.gsfc.nasa.gov/products/aerosol"]],"projectRefs":[["Image Carousel Design inspiration by Niklas Knaack","https://codepen.io/NiklasKnaack/pen/abrOMLY"],["Canva presentation inspiration","https://www.canva.com/"]],"members":[{"name":"Cüneyt Aydın","country":"Turkey","avatar":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/sa.2e16d0ba.fill-64x64.png","owner":true},{"name":"Cevdet Kaan Özdemir","country":"Turkey","avatar":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/image_1_pr2MFV1.2e16d0ba.fill-64x64.png","owner":false}]}